OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAnother very warm day. Mainly
OL,6,Fdry and bright with some sunny spells,
OL,7,Fthough the sunshine turning hazy at
OL,8,Ftimes. Chance of the odd heavy and
OL,9,Fthundery shower developing through the
OL,10,Fafternoon.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FAny showers fading away
OL,13,Fthrough the evening to leave sunny
OL,14,Fthen clear spells. Cloud and
OL,15,Foccasionally heavy rain will spread
OL,16,Feast through the early hours.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
