OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FCloudy with occasionally heavy
OL,6,Frain at first, this clearing east in
OL,7,Fthe morning. Then mainly dry with
OL,8,Fbright or warm sunny spells and just
OL,9,Fthe odd light shower possible.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FBright
OL,12,Fspells or sunny spells over the
OL,13,Fweekend, mainly dry but the odd light
OL,14,Fshower possible in the west. Dry start
OL,15,FMonday but likely turning wet and
OL,16,Fwindy later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
